  Prompt: "(quine completion (eval (do (quine prompt \"Run an 8-agent telephone relay.\\n\\nInitial message: \\\"The museum closes at five because the winter storm is approaching.\\\"\\n\\nYou must orchestrate this with subagents, not local simulation.\\n\\nRequirements:\\n- Create exactly 8 relay agents with handles :relay-1 through :relay-8.\\n- The message must pass through the relay agents in order.\\n- Each relay agent should be a fresh one-shot agent: give it the current wording in its initial task, wait for its returned wording, then create the next relay.\\n- Each relay agent preserves the meaning, changes the wording, and returns the new wording to the parent.\\n- The main agent must pass each returned wording to the next relay agent, and must wait for relay N before starting relay N+1.\\n- The final message must return to the main agent after :relay-8.\\n- Do not rewrite any message in the main agent; every rewrite must be produced by the corresponding relay agent.\\n- Relay outputs must be clean message strings only: no explanations, no maps, no code fences, and no wrapper text. A good relay-agent completion binds a rewritten string and returns that binding as the final value.\\n- The final wording must not be identical to the initial message, but must preserve that the museum closes at five because an approaching winter storm is the reason.\\n\\nWhen done, report the initial message, final message, and relay handles.\") (quote (!extend)) "
